// ICM-42688-P (TDK InvenSense): ICM-42688-P 6-axis IMU (3-axis gyroscope ±15.6-2000 dps, 3-axis
// accelerometer ±2-16 g), I2C (0x68/0x69 by AP_AD0) / I3C / SPI, 1.71-3.6 V, LGA-14 2.5 x 3 mm
// Compiled from the part sheet `parts/ICM_42688_P.json` (`parts.create`); status: checked.
// Datasheet:
// https://invensense.tdk.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/04/ds-000347_icm-42688-p-datasheet.pdf
// (DS-000347 revision 1.2: 3.7 absolute maximum ratings, 4.1 pin out and signal description (Table
// 9), 4.2 typical operating circuit, 4.3 bill of materials, 10.2 package dimensions)
// Pins: TDK InvenSense ICM-42688-P datasheet DS-000347 rev 1.2: Table 9 signal descriptions,
// Figure 4 pin out, Figures 5-6 application schematics, Table 10 BOM, Table 8 absolute maximum
// ratings, 10.2 package dimensions
// Footprint: the datasheet's land pattern
// This file may be used, changed and shared without conditions, with the board or alone.

// Note: A 3.3 V part (4 V absolute maximum): never on 5 V.

/// ICM-42688-P — ICM-42688-P 6-axis IMU (3-axis gyroscope ±15.6-2000 dps, 3-axis accelerometer
/// ±2-16 g), I2C (0x68/0x69 by AP_AD0) / I3C / SPI, 1.71-3.6 V, LGA-14 2.5 x 3 mm
part Part = device(
  footprint = Footprint {
    let ps = [
      Pad { number = "1", at = (-1.1625mm, 0.75mm), shape = shape.rect(0.475mm, 0.25mm) },
